1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:05,664
The quantity inside the sine, omega t minus k x, is called the phase.

2
00:00:05,664 --> 00:00:09,023
It tells you where in its cycle a particle is.

3
00:00:09,023 --> 00:00:17,187
Two particles separated by a distance delta x differ in phase by two pi over lambda, times delta x.

